    },
    {
      "Text": "libXi is the client-side library for the X Input Extension.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nX.Org reports: Multiple issues have been found in the X client library implementations published by X.Org for which we are releasing security fixes for.(CVE-2026-109089)\n\nX.Org reports: Multiple issues have been found in the X client library implementations published by X.Org for which we are releasing security fixes for.(CVE-2026-109090)",
